@startuml
title SA-ST02 · 聊天操作权和待答问题
caption UC-06 / BR-28～31、36～37、51 / To-Be Proposed
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam shadowing false
state "聊天操作权" as L {
 [*] --> Available
 Available --> Held : 授权用户的一个标签页取得
 Held --> Available : 正常离开通知送达或权限失效
 Held --> Grace : 平台检测断网
 Grace --> Held : 原页在五分钟内恢复
 Grace --> Available : 五分钟届满
}
state "Agent 问题" as Q {
 [*] --> Pending
 Pending --> Answered : 获权操作者回复
 Pending --> Cancelled : 发起人有权取消
}
note bottom of Q : 关闭网页或设备离线不终结问题。\n仅原发问会话消费已受理的结果。
@enduml
